A '''Clotgoyle''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Stillgore Chateau}} while fighting a {{MobSprite|Riftstalker Bloodfiend}}.

== Behavior ==
{{Green|3}} '''Clotgoyles''' spawn while a {{MobSprite|Riftstalker Bloodfiend}} is using its {{AN|Stonewrath}} ability: they will walk towards the player and try to attack them, dealing {{Stat|rt|10}} and {{Stat|hearts|1}} per hit. Killing a Clotgoyle turns it into a '''cadaver''', which can be destroyed during {{AN|Stonewrath}}. All surviving cadavers are resurrected back into Clotgoyles after the phase ends.

For every Clotgoyle alive, {{Stat|hearts|1}} is removed from the player.

